3. AUTO-LOGGING ENGINE

audit-logger.js

RESPONSIBILITIES:

intercept all system mutations

classify event type

generate structured audit entry

persist to GitHub + Supabase

emit GRID visualization event



---

EVENT TYPES

TYPE	DESCRIPTION

CHANGE	file/system modification
MERGE	system integration
REMOVAL	file/system deletion
RECONCILE	GitHub ↔ Supabase sync
SNAPSHOT	full system state capture



---

AUDIT ENTRY FORMAT

{
  event_id,
  event_type,
  timestamp,
  source_system,
  affected_paths,
  git_commit_id,
  supabase_log_id,
  grid_node_id,
  briefing_reference,
  diff_summary,
  risk_score
}


